  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Nicholas Scott is an American hospitality businessman who leads Scott Enterprises in Erie, Pennsylvania. He expanded the hotel and restaurant business established by his father, a Greek immigrant. A Cornell University graduate, he works alongside his sons in a family enterprise whose properties extend across northwestern Pennsylvania and western New York.",
